<title>USA: First Bank to add ATMs at Chevron stations.</title>
<headline>First Bank to add ATMs at Chevron stations.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bank Systems Inc said Thursday it has been chosen to provide automatic teller machine service at more than 600 gasoline and convenience stores owned by Chevron Corp's Chevron Products Co unit.</p>
<p>The hardware and support services will be provided by NCR Corp, the companies said.</p>
<p>Chevron's ATM expansion comes as part of its restructuring plan to position itself more securely in the retail convenience market, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
